<file path="README.md">
# Literasiku Server

Lightweight Go API setup using Gin.

## Run

```bash
go mod tidy
go run ./cmd/api
```

The server listens on `:8080` by default. Override it with:

```bash
PORT=3000 go run ./cmd/api
```

## Endpoints

- `GET /`
- `GET /api/health`
